  "title": "Donut",
  "group": "Charts",
  "order": 5,
  "summary": {
    "en": "A ring split into up to four segments that show parts of one whole, with the total in the middle and a labelled list beside it. The list carries the numbers; the ring shows proportion at a glance.",
    "id": "Cincin yang dibagi menjadi paling banyak empat segmen untuk menunjukkan bagian dari satu keseluruhan, dengan total di tengah dan daftar berlabel di sampingnya. Daftar membawa angkanya; cincin menunjukkan proporsi sekilas."
  },
  "titleId": "Donut",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Drawn from data, with a legend list",
        "desc": "The ring, the total and a legend with each value and share come from one config. Point at a segment or a legend row: both come forward. Switch months: segments move to their new sizes from where they are. Segments sweep in on first view.",
        "html": "<section class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width: 520px;\" aria-labelledby=\"dn-q\">\n  <div class=\"chart-card__head\"><div class=\"chart-card__titles\"><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"dn-q\">Where do new service portal accounts come from?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">New accounts by source</div></div>\n    <div class=\"chart-card__actions\"><div class=\"seg chart-card__range\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Month\" data-lds-segmented data-lds-chart-for=\"dn-src\" style=\"width: 200px;\"><span class=\"seg__thumb\"></span><button type=\"button\" class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"true\" data-set=\"nov\">November</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-set=\"oct\">October</button></div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div id=\"dn-src\" data-lds-chart='{\"type\":\"donut\",\"label\":\"Where 1,284 new service portal accounts came from this month: search 42%, email bulletin 26%, kelurahan counters 19%, other 13%.\",\"unit\":\"new accounts\",\"center\":\"1,284\",\"segments\":[{\"name\":\"Search\",\"value\":540},{\"name\":\"Email bulletin\",\"value\":334},{\"name\":\"Kelurahan counters\",\"value\":244},{\"name\":\"Other\",\"value\":166,\"color\":\"neutral\"}],\"sets\":{\"nov\":{\"center\":\"1,284\",\"label\":\"November new accounts by source.\",\"segments\":[{\"name\":\"Search\",\"value\":540},{\"name\":\"Email bulletin\",\"value\":334},{\"name\":\"Kelurahan counters\",\"value\":244},{\"name\":\"Other\",\"value\":166,\"color\":\"neutral\"}]},\"oct\":{\"center\":\"1,106\",\"label\":\"October new accounts by source.\",\"segments\":[{\"name\":\"Search\",\"value\":402},{\"name\":\"Email bulletin\",\"value\":361},{\"name\":\"Kelurahan counters\",\"value\":198},{\"name\":\"Other\",\"value\":145,\"color\":\"neutral\"}]}}}'></div>\n</section>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Thin ring in a small card",
        "desc": "`thin: true` draws a 10 px ring; `size` makes it smaller. Under about 400 px the legend wraps under the ring.",
        "html": "<section class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width: 440px;\" aria-labelledby=\"dn-b\"><div><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"dn-b\">Where does the posyandu budget go?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Planned spending, November</div></div><div data-lds-chart='{\"type\":\"donut\",\"label\":\"Monthly posyandu budget of Rp 3.2 million: cadre stipends 45%, supplementary food 22%, transport 12%, the rest 21%.\",\"unit\":\"this month\",\"center\":\"Rp 3.2 m\",\"thin\":true,\"size\":148,\"format\":{\"prefix\":\"Rp \",\"suffix\":\"k\"},\"segments\":[{\"name\":\"Cadre stipends\",\"value\":1440},{\"name\":\"Supplementary food\",\"value\":704},{\"name\":\"Transport\",\"value\":384},{\"name\":\"Everything else\",\"value\":672,\"color\":\"neutral\"}]}'></div></section>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Hygiene grades by area",
        "desc": "Switch areas: segments move to their new sizes over 480 ms on the in-out curve.",
        "html": "<div class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width: 520px;\">\n  <div class=\"cluster\" style=\"justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;\">\n    <div><div class=\"chart-card__q\">How are hygiene grades distributed?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Food stall inspections, third quarter</div></div>\n    <div class=\"seg\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Area\" data-lds-segmented style=\"width: 180px;\">\n      <span class=\"seg__thumb\"></span>\n      <button class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"true\" onclick=\"const c = this.closest('.chart-card'); c.querySelectorAll('circle').forEach(e => { const [d, o] = e.dataset.a.split('|'); e.style.strokeDasharray = d; e.style.strokeDashoffset = o; }); c.querySelectorAll('b[data-a]').forEach(e => e.textContent = e.dataset.a); c.querySelector('[data-total]').textContent = '42';\">Area 1</button>\n      <button class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"const c = this.closest('.chart-card'); c.querySelectorAll('circle').forEach(e => { const [d, o] = e.dataset.b.split('|'); e.style.strokeDasharray = d; e.style.strokeDashoffset = o; }); c.querySelectorAll('b[data-b]').forEach(e => e.textContent = e.dataset.b); c.querySelector('[data-total]').textContent = '42';\">Area 2</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"cluster\" style=\"--gap: 28px;\">\n    <div style=\"position: relative; width: 168px; height: 168px; flex: none;\">\n      <svg class=\"donut\" viewBox=\"0 0 168 168\" style=\"width: 168px; height: 168px; transform: rotate(-90deg);\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Hygiene grades: A 12, B 18, C 9, D or lower 3 of 42 food stalls\">\n      <circle cx=\"84\" cy=\"84\" r=\"64\" style=\"stroke: var(--series-1); stroke-dasharray: 112.89 289.23; stroke-dashoffset: 0.00;\" data-a=\"112.89 289.23|0.00\" data-b=\"74.60 327.53|0.00\"></circle>\n      <circle cx=\"84\" cy=\"84\" r=\"64\" style=\"stroke: var(--series-2); stroke-dasharray: 170.34 231.79; stroke-dashoffset: -114.89;\" data-a=\"170.34 231.79|-114.89\" data-b=\"151.19 250.93|-76.60\"></circle>\n      <circle cx=\"84\" cy=\"84\" r=\"64\" style=\"stroke: var(--series-3); stroke-dasharray: 84.17 317.95; stroke-dashoffset: -287.23;\" data-a=\"84.17 317.95|-287.23\" data-b=\"122.47 279.66|-229.79\"></circle>\n      <circle cx=\"84\" cy=\"84\" r=\"64\" style=\"stroke: var(--series-4); stroke-dasharray: 26.72 375.40; stroke-dashoffset: -373.40;\" data-a=\"26.72 375.40|-373.40\" data-b=\"45.87 356.25|-354.25\"></circle>\n      </svg>\n      <div class=\"center\" style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0;\"><div><div style=\"font: var(--type-title-2); color: var(--text-strong); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\" data-total>42</div><div style=\"font: var(--type-footnote); color: var(--text-subtle);\">food stalls</div></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stack\" style=\"--gap: 10px; flex: 1; min-width: 160px;\">\n      <div class=\"cluster\" style=\"flex-wrap: nowrap; --gap: 10px; font: var(--type-subhead); color: var(--text-default);\"><span style=\"width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 3px; flex: none; background: var(--series-1);\"></span><span style=\"flex: 1;\">A</span><b style=\"font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-strong); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\" data-a=\"12\" data-b=\"8\">12</b></div>\n      <div class=\"cluster\" style=\"flex-wrap: nowrap; --gap: 10px; font: var(--type-subhead); color: var(--text-default);\"><span style=\"width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 3px; flex: none; background: var(--series-2);\"></span><span style=\"flex: 1;\">B</span><b style=\"font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-strong); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\" data-a=\"18\" data-b=\"16\">18</b></div>\n      <div class=\"cluster\" style=\"flex-wrap: nowrap; --gap: 10px; font: var(--type-subhead); color: var(--text-default);\"><span style=\"width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 3px; flex: none; background: var(--series-3);\"></span><span style=\"flex: 1;\">C</span><b style=\"font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-strong); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\" data-a=\"9\" data-b=\"13\">9</b></div>\n      <div class=\"cluster\" style=\"flex-wrap: nowrap; --gap: 10px; font: var(--type-subhead); color: var(--text-default);\"><span style=\"width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 3px; flex: none; background: var(--series-4);\"></span><span style=\"flex: 1;\">D or lower</span><b style=\"font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-strong); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\" data-a=\"3\" data-b=\"5\">3</b></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Digambar dari data, dengan daftar legenda",
        "desc": "Cincin, total, dan legenda berisi nilai serta porsi setiap bagian berasal dari satu config. Arahkan kursor ke segmen atau baris legenda: keduanya menonjol. Ganti bulan: segmen bergerak ke ukuran barunya dari posisinya sekarang. Segmen menyapu masuk saat pertama terlihat.",
        "html": "<section class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width: 520px;\" aria-labelledby=\"dn-q\">\n  <div class=\"chart-card__head\"><div class=\"chart-card__titles\"><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"dn-q\">Dari mana akun baru portal layanan berasal?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Akun baru menurut sumber</div></div>\n    <div class=\"chart-card__actions\"><div class=\"seg chart-card__range\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Bulan\" data-lds-segmented data-lds-chart-for=\"dn-src\" style=\"width: 200px;\"><span class=\"seg__thumb\"></span><button type=\"button\" class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"true\" data-set=\"nov\">November</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-set=\"oct\">Oktober</button></div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div id=\"dn-src\" data-lds-chart='{\"type\":\"donut\",\"label\":\"Asal 1.284 akun baru portal layanan bulan ini: mesin pencari 42%, buletin email 26%, loket kelurahan 19%, lainnya 13%.\",\"unit\":\"akun baru\",\"center\":\"1.284\",\"segments\":[{\"name\":\"Mesin pencari\",\"value\":540},{\"name\":\"Buletin email\",\"value\":334},{\"name\":\"Loket kelurahan\",\"value\":244},{\"name\":\"Lainnya\",\"value\":166,\"color\":\"neutral\"}],\"sets\":{\"nov\":{\"center\":\"1.284\",\"label\":\"Akun baru November menurut sumber.\",\"segments\":[{\"name\":\"Mesin pencari\",\"value\":540},{\"name\":\"Buletin email\",\"value\":334},{\"name\":\"Loket kelurahan\",\"value\":244},{\"name\":\"Lainnya\",\"value\":166,\"color\":\"neutral\"}]},\"oct\":{\"center\":\"1.106\",\"label\":\"Akun baru Oktober menurut sumber.\",\"segments\":[{\"name\":\"Mesin pencari\",\"value\":402},{\"name\":\"Buletin email\",\"value\":361},{\"name\":\"Loket kelurahan\",\"value\":198},{\"name\":\"Lainnya\",\"value\":145,\"color\":\"neutral\"}]}}}'></div>\n</section>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Cincin tipis di kartu kecil",
        "desc": "`thin: true` menggambar cincin 10 px; `size` membuatnya lebih kecil. Di bawah sekitar 400 px legenda turun ke bawah cincin.",
        "html": "<section class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width: 440px;\" aria-labelledby=\"dn-b\"><div><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"dn-b\">Ke mana anggaran posyandu dipakai?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Rencana belanja, November</div></div><div data-lds-chart='{\"type\":\"donut\",\"label\":\"Anggaran posyandu bulanan Rp 3,2 juta: honor kader 45%, makanan tambahan 22%, transport 12%, sisanya 21%.\",\"unit\":\"bulan ini\",\"center\":\"Rp 3,2 jt\",\"thin\":true,\"size\":148,\"format\":{\"prefix\":\"Rp \",\"suffix\":\" rb\"},\"segments\":[{\"name\":\"Honor kader\",\"value\":1440},{\"name\":\"Makanan tambahan\",\"value\":704},{\"name\":\"Transport\",\"value\":384},{\"name\":\"Lainnya\",\"value\":672,\"color\":\"neutral\"}]}'></div></section>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Nilai kebersihan per wilayah",
        "desc": "Ganti wilayah: segmen bergerak ke ukuran barunya selama 480 ms dengan kurva in-out.",
        "html": "<div class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width: 520px;\">\n  <div class=\"cluster\" style=\"justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;\">\n    <div><div class=\"chart-card__q\">Bagaimana sebaran nilai kebersihan?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Hasil pemeriksaan warung makan, triwulan III</div></div>\n    <div class=\"seg\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Wilayah\" data-lds-segmented style=\"width: 180px;\">\n      <span class=\"seg__thumb\"></span>\n      <button class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"true\" onclick=\"const c = this.closest('.chart-card'); c.querySelectorAll('circle').forEach(e => { const [d, o] = e.dataset.a.split('|'); e.style.strokeDasharray = d; e.style.strokeDashoffset = o; }); c.querySelectorAll('b[data-a]').forEach(e => e.textContent = e.dataset.a); c.querySelector('[data-total]').textContent = '42';\">Wilayah 1</button>\n      <button class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"const c = this.closest('.chart-card'); c.querySelectorAll('circle').forEach(e => { const [d, o] = e.dataset.b.split('|'); e.style.strokeDasharray = d; e.style.strokeDashoffset = o; }); c.querySelectorAll('b[data-b]').forEach(e => e.textContent = e.dataset.b); c.querySelector('[data-total]').textContent = '42';\">Wilayah 2</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"cluster\" style=\"--gap: 28px;\">\n    <div style=\"position: relative; width: 168px; height: 168px; flex: none;\">\n      <svg class=\"donut\" viewBox=\"0 0 168 168\" style=\"width: 168px; height: 168px; transform: rotate(-90deg);\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Nilai kebersihan: A 12, B 18, C 9, D atau lebih rendah 3 dari 42 warung\">\n      <circle cx=\"84\" cy=\"84\" r=\"64\" style=\"stroke: var(--series-1); stroke-dasharray: 112.89 289.23; stroke-dashoffset: 0.00;\" data-a=\"112.89 289.23|0.00\" data-b=\"74.60 327.53|0.00\"></circle>\n      <circle cx=\"84\" cy=\"84\" r=\"64\" style=\"stroke: var(--series-2); stroke-dasharray: 170.34 231.79; stroke-dashoffset: -114.89;\" data-a=\"170.34 231.79|-114.89\" data-b=\"151.19 250.93|-76.60\"></circle>\n      <circle cx=\"84\" cy=\"84\" r=\"64\" style=\"stroke: var(--series-3); stroke-dasharray: 84.17 317.95; stroke-dashoffset: -287.23;\" data-a=\"84.17 317.95|-287.23\" data-b=\"122.47 279.66|-229.79\"></circle>\n      <circle cx=\"84\" cy=\"84\" r=\"64\" style=\"stroke: var(--series-4); stroke-dasharray: 26.72 375.40; stroke-dashoffset: -373.40;\" data-a=\"26.72 375.40|-373.40\" data-b=\"45.87 356.25|-354.25\"></circle>\n      </svg>\n      <div class=\"center\" style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0;\"><div><div style=\"font: var(--type-title-2); color: var(--text-strong); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\" data-total>42</div><div style=\"font: var(--type-footnote); color: var(--text-subtle);\">warung</div></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stack\" style=\"--gap: 10px; flex: 1; min-width: 160px;\">\n      <div class=\"cluster\" style=\"flex-wrap: nowrap; --gap: 10px; font: var(--type-subhead); color: var(--text-default);\"><span style=\"width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 3px; flex: none; background: var(--series-1);\"></span><span style=\"flex: 1;\">A</span><b style=\"font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-strong); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\" data-a=\"12\" data-b=\"8\">12</b></div>\n      <div class=\"cluster\" style=\"flex-wrap: nowrap; --gap: 10px; font: var(--type-subhead); color: var(--text-default);\"><span style=\"width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 3px; flex: none; background: var(--series-2);\"></span><span style=\"flex: 1;\">B</span><b style=\"font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-strong); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\" data-a=\"18\" data-b=\"16\">18</b></div>\n      <div class=\"cluster\" style=\"flex-wrap: nowrap; --gap: 10px; font: var(--type-subhead); color: var(--text-default);\"><span style=\"width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 3px; flex: none; background: var(--series-3);\"></span><span style=\"flex: 1;\">C</span><b style=\"font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-strong); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\" data-a=\"9\" data-b=\"13\">9</b></div>\n      <div class=\"cluster\" style=\"flex-wrap: nowrap; --gap: 10px; font: var(--type-subhead); color: var(--text-default);\"><span style=\"width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 3px; flex: none; background: var(--series-4);\"></span><span style=\"flex: 1;\">D atau lebih rendah</span><b style=\"font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-strong); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\" data-a=\"3\" data-b=\"5\">3</b></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
